@startuml phase9_auto_reconnect_sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Phase 9: 自動再接続シーケンス (実測データ 2026-01-17)

participant "Camera\nThread" as CAM
participant "Action\nQueue" as AQ
participant "TCP\nServer" as TCP_SP
participant "GS2200M\nWiFi" as WIFI
participant "PC\nClient" as PC

note over CAM, PC: 正常動作中 (約49分間)

== パケットロス発生 (12:08:34) ==

TCP_SP -> WIFI: send(frame_data)\n10パケットバースト
WIFI -> PC: [P.] seq=334221269\n(一部ロスト)
PC -> WIFI: [.] ack=334221269\n重複ACK x14
note right of PC: パケットロス検出

== RTO再送 (12:08:37) ==

WIFI -> WIFI: RTOタイムアウト\n(約3秒)
WIFI -> PC: [P.] seq=334221269\n(再送成功)
PC -> WIFI: [.] ack=334231517\n(回復)

== GS2200M 切断 (12:08:37.55) ==

note over WIFI: GS2200M内部ロジック:\n重複ACK検出後に\nFIN送信を決定
WIFI -> PC: [F.] FIN
PC -> WIFI: [.] ACK

== Phase 9: Spresense側再接続待機 ==

TCP_SP -> TCP_SP: handle_disconnect()\nclient_fd = -1
note over TCP_SP: 状態: RECONNECTING

TCP_SP -> TCP_SP: wait_reconnect()\naccept() 待機

== Phase 9: PC側再接続 ==

PC -> PC: 切断検出\n(read timeout)
note over PC: reconnect()\n2秒待機後

PC -> WIFI: [S] SYN (port 53336)
WIFI -> TCP_SP: accept()
TCP_SP -> WIFI: connection
WIFI -> PC: [S.] SYN-ACK
PC -> WIFI: [.] ACK

note over TCP_SP: 状態: CONNECTED\nreconnect_count = 1

== ストリーミング再開 ==

CAM -> AQ: push(frame)
AQ -> TCP_SP: pop() & send()
TCP_SP -> WIFI: send(frame_data)
WIFI -> PC: MJPEG frame
note over PC: フレーム表示再開\n(12:08:39)

note over CAM, PC #lightgreen: **自動再接続成功**\n2秒のダウンタイムで復旧

@enduml
